§§ `12. Limitation period`

`nothing known to the consumer` MEANS `Consumer Knowledge Facts` OF NOTHING, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Consumer Knowledge Facts`
`actual knowledge on` d MEANS `Consumer Knowledge Facts` OF JUST d, NOTHING, NOTHING, FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Consumer Knowledge Facts`
`knowledge only from expert advice ascertainable on` d MEANS `Consumer Knowledge Facts` OF NOTHING, NOTHING, JUST d, FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Consumer Knowledge Facts`
`knowledge from expert advice, all reasonable steps to obtain it having been taken, ascertainable on` d MEANS `Consumer Knowledge Facts` OF NOTHING, NOTHING, JUST d, TRUE

-- Limitation Facts: kind of action, commenced, last material event, failure to comply, cancellation,
-- Commission alleges an unfair practice in respect of a consumer, what the consumer knew,
-- under a disability, date the disability ended or the person died.
GIVEN commenced IS A DATE
      event IS A DATE
      knew IS A `Consumer Knowledge Facts`
GIVETH A `Limitation Facts`
`an action under section 6 commenced` commenced `on a last material event of` event `where` knew MEANS
    `Limitation Facts` OF `an action under section 6`, commenced, event, event, event, FALSE, knew, FALSE, NOTHING

-- s 12(1): 2 years after the later of the last material event and the earliest knowledge date
#ASSERT `the action is commenced in time` (`an action under section 6 commenced` (YMD 2026 3 1) `on a last material event of` (YMD 2024 3 1) `where` `nothing known to the consumer`)
#ASSERT NOT `the action is commenced in time` (`an action under section 6 commenced` (YMD 2026 3 2) `on a last material event of` (YMD 2024 3 1) `where` `nothing known to the consumer`)
-- knowledge later than the event: the later date governs ("whichever occurs later")
#ASSERT `the action is commenced in time` (`an action under section 6 commenced` (YMD 2026 8 31) `on a last material event of` (YMD 2024 3 1) `where` (`actual knowledge on` (YMD 2024 9 1)))
#ASSERT `the action is commenced in time` (`an action under section 6 commenced` (YMD 2026 9 1) `on a last material event of` (YMD 2024 3 1) `where` (`actual knowledge on` (YMD 2024 9 1)))
#ASSERT NOT `the action is commenced in time` (`an action under section 6 commenced` (YMD 2026 9 2) `on a last material event of` (YMD 2024 3 1) `where` (`actual knowledge on` (YMD 2024 9 1)))
-- knowledge earlier than the event: the event governs
#ASSERT NOT `the action is commenced in time` (`an action under section 6 commenced` (YMD 2026 3 2) `on a last material event of` (YMD 2024 3 1) `where` (`actual knowledge on` (YMD 2023 1 1)))
-- s 12(1)(b) and (7): an earlier date from which knowledge might reasonably be expected
#ASSERT NOT `the action is commenced in time` (`an action under section 6 commenced` (YMD 2026 9 2) `on a last material event of` (YMD 2024 3 1) `where` (`Consumer Knowledge Facts` OF JUST (YMD 2024 9 1), JUST (YMD 2024 4 1), NOTHING, FALSE))
#ASSERT `the action is commenced in time` (`an action under section 6 commenced` (YMD 2026 4 1) `on a last material event of` (YMD 2024 3 1) `where` (`Consumer Knowledge Facts` OF JUST (YMD 2024 9 1), JUST (YMD 2024 4 1), NOTHING, FALSE))
-- s 12(8): knowledge from expert advice counts unless the consumer took all reasonable steps to obtain it
GIVEN m IS A MAYBE DATE
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the possible date is` m `exactly` d MEANS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN JUST x THEN x EQUALS d
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

GIVEN m IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the possible date is absent` m MEANS
    CONSIDER m
    WHEN JUST x THEN FALSE
    WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE

#ASSERT `the possible date is` (`the earliest date on which the consumer had knowledge` (`knowledge only from expert advice ascertainable on` (YMD 2024 5 5))) `exactly` (YMD 2024 5 5)
#ASSERT `the possible date is absent` (`the earliest date on which the consumer had knowledge` (`knowledge from expert advice, all reasonable steps to obtain it having been taken, ascertainable on` (YMD 2024 5 5)))
-- leap day: 2 years after 29 Feb 2024 is taken as 28 Feb 2026 (NOTES.md F4)
